[statement]
A package is installed as soon as its condition holds, before the names
still waiting are decided: both providers of `cmd` depend on `base`, which
is installed first, and `p2`, whose condition names `base`, is installed
with it and answers `cmd`. `p1`, listed first, is not installed. The rule of
`reduced/rofi-blocks-takes-rofi-x11-wayland`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:cmd

P:base
V:1

P:p1
V:1
p:cmd=1
D:base

P:p2
V:1
p:cmd=1
D:base
i:base

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install p2 1
install app 1
